NORDIC UI - Interface Overhaul 2.4.1
Author: outobugi, also credited as Dopesan (dopesan) in the fomod.
https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/49881
Version date: 2021-08-14. Permission verified and art extracted: 2026-10-06.
"Permissions are open to use my art as you wish."
The next sentence asks users to check SkyUI's and SkyHUD's permissions.

Only generated Godot meshes for the author's art are included. Each entry in
nordic/provenance.json names its source movie, character ID and SHA-256 of the
art tag type and payload without the movie-local ID. All SWF and GFX art from
the user's SkyUI_SE.bsa and Skyrim - Interface.bsa was compared before export.
Exact matches, including renumbered definitions, and shapes depending on an
excluded bitmap are rejected. No original mod file, archive, script, font,
layout, SkyHUD component, third-party patch or WAV sound is included.

